Bugfix: Reject empty VSS snapshot device objects on Windows

When creating a Windows VSS snapshot succeeded but `GetSnapshotProperties()`
returned an empty snapshot device object (for instance with some third-party
VSS providers), restic treated the snapshot as usable and joined paths onto
an empty prefix, resolving them relative to the current working drive. Restic
now rejects empty VSS snapshot device objects, cleans up the snapshot, reports
the failure, and falls back to the original path.

https://github.com/restic/restic/issues/22217
